# Trivy findings deliberately accepted, with the reason. Anything not
# justified here should be fixed, not added.

# KSV-0047 — "Role permits privilege escalation from node proxy".
# The benchmark Prometheus scrapes cAdvisor and the kubelet through the API
# server proxy (/api/v1/nodes/<node>/proxy/metrics/cadvisor), which cannot work
# without get on nodes/proxy. This is benchmarks/egernia-performance/manifests/
# monitoring.yaml only: applied to a throwaway kind cluster by the benchmark
# harness, never rendered by the Helm chart and never deployed. The alternative
# (scraping kubelets directly on :10250) would change the measurement path that
# the published results were taken on.
AVD-KSV-0047
KSV-0047
KSV0047

# DS-0002 — "Specify at least 1 USER command with non-root user".
# benchmarks/tap-compare/targets/dachs/Dockerfile only: the benchmark's DaCHS
# comparison container reproduces the gavodachs2-server Debian package's own
# layout, whose entrypoint must start the bundled PostgreSQL cluster (root),
# after which DaCHS drops to its own dachsroot/postgres users. A USER line
# would break `service postgresql start`. Local benchmark tooling, never a
# service image, never deployed by the chart.
AVD-DS-0002
DS-0002
DS0002
